<?php declare(strict_types=1); namespace Annam; $title='Order reports & sales';$subtitle='Live totals and quantities. All dates and times use India time.'; ?>
<section class="o-card"><header class="report-heading"><div><h2>Today’s sales · <?= e(date('j M Y')) ?></h2><p>Updated <?= e(date('g:i:s A',strtotime($sales['as_of']))) ?> · Refresh whenever you need the latest figures.</p></div><a class="o-btn" href="<?= e($_SERVER['REQUEST_URI']) ?>">Refresh totals</a></header><div class="report-stats"><?php foreach(['order_value'=>'Order value, including delivery','paid_order_value'=>'Paid value of today’s orders','pending_order_value'=>'Awaiting payment','order_count'=>'Orders received'] as $k=>$label): ?><div class="report-stat"><span><?= e($label) ?></span><strong><?= $k==='order_count'?e($sales[$k]):money($sales[$k]) ?></strong></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><details class="report-finance"><summary>Payments collected today</summary><div class="o-grid-form"><?php foreach(['manual_receipts'=>'Manual food payments','online_receipts'=>'Verified online payments','courier_receipts'=>'Courier payments','refunds'=>'Verified online refunds','net_receipts'=>'Net receipts'] as $k=>$label): ?><div><strong><?= e($label) ?></strong><p><?= money($sales[$k]) ?></p></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><p>Payments collected today can include older orders. They differ from today’s order value. Online receipts and refunds use verified payment timestamps; older records without those timestamps are not guessed.</p></details><p>Cancelled orders and Razorpay test orders are excluded from sales.</p></section>
<form method="get" class="o-card o-form"><h2>Product quantities</h2><?php if(!empty($form_error)): ?><div class="o-flash o-flash-error" role="alert"><?= e($form_error) ?></div><?php endif; ?><p>Choose when orders were received. Start is included; end is excluded. Use Delivery date separately when preparing tomorrow’s meals. Reports work while ordering is still open.</p><div class="o-grid-form"><label class="o-field"><span>Start <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input type="datetime-local" name="start" value="<?= e($report['start']) ?>" required></label><label class="o-field"><span>End <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input type="datetime-local" name="end" value="<?= e($report['end']) ?>" required></label><label class="o-field"><span>Meal</span><select name="meal"><option value="">All food categories</option><?php foreach(['breakfast','lunch','dinner','snacks'] as $key): ?><option value="<?= e($key) ?>" <?= ($_GET['meal']??'')===$key?'selected':'' ?>><?= e(ucfirst($key)) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label class="o-field"><span>Product name or ID</span><input name="product" value="<?= e($_GET['product']??'') ?>"></label><label class="o-field"><span>Delivery date (optional)</span><input type="date" name="delivery_date" value="<?= e($_GET['delivery_date']??'') ?>"></label><label class="o-check"><input type="checkbox" name="include_cancelled" value="1" <?= !empty($_GET['include_cancelled'])?'checked':'' ?>><span class="o-switch-ui"><i></i></span><b>Include cancelled orders</b></label></div><div class="o-btn-row"><button class="o-btn o-btn-primary">View report</button><button class="o-btn" name="export" value="csv">Download CSV</button></div></form>
<section class="o-card"><h2><?= e($report['quantity']) ?> items · <?= e($report['order_count']) ?> matching orders</h2><p>Selected product value: <?= money($report['items_amount']) ?>. Product amounts exclude order-level delivery and tax. Order counts cannot be added across category reports.</p><div class="report-table"><table class="o-table"><thead><tr><th>Food category</th><th>Product</th><th>Catalog category</th><th>Total quantity</th><th>Items amount</th><th>Orders</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($report['rows'] as $row): ?><tr><td><?= e(ucfirst($row['meal'])) ?></td><td><?= e($row['product']) ?></td><td><?= e($row['catalog_category']) ?></td><td><?= e($row['quantity']) ?></td><td><?= money($row['amount']) ?></td><td><?= e($row['orders']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$report['rows']): ?><tr><td colspan="6">No matching orders received during this period.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div></section>
